WEBVTT

00:06:27.704 --> 00:06:31.947
But if you text now, or if you are someone who

00:06:31.947 --> 00:06:35.244
is aware of the substrate of texting the way it's become,

00:06:35.244 --> 00:06:36.934
you'll notice that LOL

00:06:36.934 --> 00:06:39.004
does not mean laughing out loud anymore.

00:06:39.004 --> 00:06:42.794
It's evolved into something that is much subtler.

00:06:42.794 --> 00:06:46.241
This is an actual text that was done

00:06:46.241 --> 00:06:50.173
by a non-male person of about 20 years old

00:06:50.173 --> 00:06:51.668
not too long ago.

00:06:51.668 --> 00:06:54.620
"I love the font you're using, btw."

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:58.382
Julie: "lol thanks gmail is being slow right now"

00:06:58.382 --> 00:07:00.124
Now if you think about it, that's not funny.